out of breath! My hair was a mess and I didn't have time to comb it. Then, I was so nervous that I kept saying dumb things all evening. She must have thought I was just a boring guy.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        That doesn't sound good ...", "id": 2, "time": "16500", "image": "engenn7le11ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        Tell me about it! It got so bad that my limbs became numb. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Did you at least try to make small talk?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        I did, but I doubt that it made a difference to her. She kept looking at her watch all evening.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        You must be really disappointed right now! I'm sorry! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        Yeah, and she must have felt like I was just a waste of her time. Online dating is so hard!", "id": 3, "time": "45000", "image": "engenn7le11ob04re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le11ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le11ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}